-Equation~\eqref{eq:adjoint-force-response} shows that an aerodynamic output weights the error with a different, flow-dependent sensitivity.
-Consequently, exact preservation of a global integral can coexist with a visible force discontinuity, while an uncorrected pointwise transfer can produce little immediate force error if its imbalance is weakly coupled to the output.
